  m_Name: FibromyalgiaBookPage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DiseaseBookPageData
  diseaseId: fibromyalgia
  diseaseName: "F\u0130BROM\u0130YALJ\u0130"
  generalInfo: "Fibromiyalji, yayg\u0131n kas-iskelet sistemi a\u011Fr\u0131lar\u0131
    ve kronik yorgunluk ile seyreden bir a\u011Fr\u0131 sendromudur. Hastalarda uyku
    bozuklu\u011Fu, halsizlik ve yayg\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Yayg\u0131n a\u011Fr\u0131 var olmas\u0131, belirgin halsizlik mevcut
    olmas\u0131, kas-eklem a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 mevcut olmas\u0131 ve odaklanma
    sorunu var olmas\u0131 fibromiyaljide s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir.
    Baz\u0131 hastalarda sabah yorgun kalk\u0131yor olabilir."
  diagnosisTips: "\u015Eikayetler yakla\u015F\u0131k 1 ayd\u0131r var olmas\u0131,
    uyku sonras\u0131 dinlenemiyor olmas\u0131 ve stresle yak\u0131nmalar\u0131n
    artmas\u0131 fibromiyalji lehine \xF6nemli bulgulard\u0131r. Belirgin inflamasyon
    bulgusu olmamas\u0131 ay\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 tan\u0131da \xF6nemlidir."
  diseaseImage: {fileID: 0}
